{% schema %}
  {
    
    "name": "Section 1",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-632340261300667365 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/photobrickusa/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=632340261250270181&sectionId=632340261300667365)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjXGifa5qV_text","label":"ggjXGifa5qV_text","default":"Heartwarming Personalized Gifts Every Grandparent Will Love"},{"type":"html","id":"ggW7PX3wjrW_text","label":"ggW7PX3wjrW_text","default":"<i>\"The most meaningful gifts for grandparents aren't measured by their price they're measured by the memories they bring back.\"</i>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1Tn4MpcQm_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"gg1Tn4MpcQm_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/10f415ca-4f79-412b-8366-6d89736007b9.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggICevSNy-j_text","label":"ggICevSNy-j_text","default":"<p>Finding the perfect gift for grandparents can be surprisingly difficult. After years of birthdays, holidays, and anniversaries, they've likely received countless sweaters, mugs, and gift baskets. While those presents are thoughtful, the gifts they often treasure most are the ones that remind them of the people they love.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A personalized gift transforms a special family moment into something they can enjoy every day. Whether it's a cherished family portrait, a photo with the grandchildren, or a memory from a family vacation, these moments become lasting keepsakes that celebrate love across generations.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Memobrick offers a unique way to preserve those memories by turning a favorite photo into a personalized brick mosaic that's both meaningful and fun to build.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpxC7hmeL3_text","label":"ggpxC7hmeL3_text","default":"<p><strong>The Moments Grandparents Never Forget</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCA4YgjfTe_text","label":"ggCA4YgjfTe_text","default":"<p>Ask any grandparent about their happiest memories, and chances are they'll talk about family rather than possessions.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Watching grandchildren grow up, celebrating birthdays together, sharing holiday meals, and spending quiet afternoons with loved ones often become the moments they treasure most.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A personalized gift captures those memories in a way that ordinary presents simply can't. Instead of giving something that may eventually be replaced or forgotten, you're giving a reminder of the people who make life meaningful.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Every glance at a cherished photo can bring back stories, smiles, and the feeling of being surrounded by family even when everyone lives far apart.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggubmSdvFNJ_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggubmSdvFNJ_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/1a088b08-b54d-4130-8dc9-410c3fe8a83a.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOQDMpqdah_text","label":"ggOQDMpqdah_text","default":"<p><strong>A Gift That Brings Generations Together</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggbM2iqZDLT_text","label":"ggbM2iqZDLT_text","default":"<p>Memobrick is more than a personalized photo gift it's an experience that celebrates family.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Grandparents can build it with their grandchildren during a weekend visit, enjoy working on it together over the holidays, or proudly display the finished mosaic in their home.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The beauty of Memobrick is that it creates two lasting memories: the cherished moment captured in the photo and the joyful experience of bringing that memory to life, one brick at a time.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>More than home décor, it's a conversation piece that invites stories, laughter, and family traditions to continue across generations.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpWw2YAE48_text","label":"ggpWw2YAE48_text","default":"<p><strong>Photos That Make the Most Meaningful Gifts</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-gevXVUP5_text","label":"gg-gevXVUP5_text","default":"<p>The best personalized gifts begin with the right photo. Consider choosing a picture that tells a story rather than simply looking perfect.</p><p>Some wonderful ideas include:</p><ul><li>Grandparents with all of their grandchildren.</li><li>Three-generation family portraits.</li><li>Holiday celebrations.</li><li>Baby's first birthday.</li><li>Graduation day.</li><li>Wedding memories.</li><li>Family vacations.</li><li>A favorite photo with a beloved pet.</li><li>A candid moment filled with laughter.</li></ul><p>The most meaningful photo is often the one that instantly brings back a treasured memory.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggUD9UNSEoi_text","label":"ggUD9UNSEoi_text","default":"<p><strong>More Than a Gift A Family Legacy</strong></p>"}],
    "blocks": [{"type": "@app"}],
    "locales": {}
